sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant User
    participant Browser
    participant UnityShell as Unity Host Page
    participant Bridge as Unity Web Auth Bridge
    participant Dashboard
    participant Supabase
    participant Cookie as Browser Cookie Jar
    participant UnityRuntime as Unity WebGL Runtime

    User->>Browser: Open Unity space URL
    Browser->>UnityShell: Load Unity host page
    UnityShell->>Bridge: Initialize web auth bridge
    Bridge->>Cookie: Read metadyn_token

    alt Token missing
        Bridge-->>Browser: Redirect to dashboard login with redirect=current_unity_url
        Browser->>Dashboard: Open login/signup page
        User->>Dashboard: Authenticate
        Dashboard->>Supabase: signIn / signUp
        Supabase-->>Dashboard: Session + access_token
        Dashboard->>Cookie: Set metadyn_token for .metadyn.xyz
        Dashboard-->>Browser: Redirect back to Unity space
        Browser->>UnityShell: Reload page
        UnityShell->>Bridge: Check cookie again
    else Token present
        Bridge-->>UnityRuntime: Provide token to Unity auth manager
    end

    UnityRuntime->>Bridge: Read token
    alt Token available
        UnityRuntime-->>User: Continue load/spawn flow
    else Token unavailable after redirect
        UnityRuntime-->>User: Remain gated / login required
    end
